            "h3": "2. Interrupt the craving",
            "body": ""
          },
          {
            "h3": "3. Replace the behavior",
            "body": ""
          },
          {
            "h3": "4. Reduce the reward loop",
            "body": ""
          },
          {
            "h3": "5. Rewire repetition",
            "body": ""
